@startuml
actor User
participant "AuthScreen\n(Compose)" as UI
participant "AuthViewModel" as VM
participant "AuthRepository" as Repo
participant "AuthApiService (Retrofit)" as API
participant "Server"

User -> UI : submit credentials
UI -> VM : onLogin(email, pass)
VM -> Repo : login(request)
Repo -> API : POST /api/auth/login
API -> Server : HTTP
Server --> API : 200 { accessToken }
API --> Repo : Response<LoginResponse>
Repo --> VM : LoginResult(success, token)
VM --> UI : update state (authenticated)
UI -> User : navigate Home
@enduml

